{'symbol': 'INFO', 'date': '2021-10-22 12:08:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL AND IHS MARKIT MERGER RECEIVES CONDITIONAL APPROVAL FROM EUROPEAN COMMISSION', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LONDON, OCT. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL (NYSE: SPGI) AND IHS MARKIT (NYSE: INFO) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE RECEIVED A CONDITIONAL PHASE 1 APPROVAL FOR THEIR $44 BILLION MERGER FROM THE EUROPEAN COMMISSION (EC), MARKING ANOTHER SIGNIFICANT STEP TOWARD THE COMBINATION OF THESE HIGHLY COMPLEMENTARY COMPANIES. "THE EUROPEAN COMMISSION\'S DECISION PROVIDES CLARITY ON THE STEPS WE WILL NEED TO IMPLEMENT TO COMPLETE OUR COMBINATION," SAID DOUGLAS L.'}